{"text": "That night, Scrooge saw Marleys face in the knocker on his front door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He looked again, but it was only a knocker, so he went inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later, as he sat by his small fire, he heard a loud clanking noise. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Marleys ghost came straight through the heavy door, which was still locked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The ghost dragged a long chain that was made of cash boxes, keys, and heavy purses. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I wear the chain I forged in life, said the ghost. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I made it link by link, because I cared only about money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But you were always a good man of business, Jacob, said Scrooge. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Mankind was my business, cried the ghost, wringing its hands. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Marley warned that Scrooges own chain was even longer and heavier than his. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Three Spirits will visit you, he said, They are your only hope. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the ghost floated out through the window, and Scrooge fell asleep at once.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ",", " ", "S", "c", "r", "o", "o", "g", "e", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "M", "a", "r", "l", "e", "y", "s", " ", "f", "a", "c", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "n", "o", "c", "k", "e", "r", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "f", "r", "o", "n", "t", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "a", "g", "a", "i", "n", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "k", "n", "o", "c", "k", "e", "r", ",", " ", "s", "o", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "i", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\""